# Check text files out with LF on every OS. Benchmark preflight pins sha256
# hashes of source, deployment and bundle files; Windows' default CRLF checkout
# changed those bytes, so every pinned hash "differed" on Windows CI. All text
# files are already stored with LF, so this changes no repository content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the reviewed vendor bytes and integrity hash identical on Windows.
src/goodvision_harness/assets/opencv-4.13.0.js -text -whitespace
